WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:02.185
The log Brunn–Minkowski inequality.

2
00:00:02.800 --> 00:00:05.634
Two symmetric boxes, blended geometrically. Its area

3
00:00:05.634 --> 00:00:08.063
never falls below their geometric mean.

4
00:00:08.800 --> 00:00:12.734
Follow a path of blended bodies; volume reduces to a variance inequality.

5
00:00:14.200 --> 00:00:17.507
Claimed: true for all origin-symmetric bodies, every dimension.

6
00:00:18.100 --> 00:00:19.237
Main theorem Lean-checked.
